-- title:
--   Crude depth guard, guard-width form
-- statement:
--   Under the hypotheses of the crude depth guard, if moreover $C_1 \ge 2 + m \log s$ (a real number), then every $e \le d$ satisfies
--
--   $$A(e) \le 2 s (E + 8)\, d^{C_1}.$$
--
--   This is the form in which the guard constant $C_1$ of the κ framework's `CrudeAssembly` enters.
--
